Cloning this source

Author: SeaMc <sauthm_2015@qq.com>
Last Updated: November 7, 2026

===================

When you need to download the project repository locally
(i.e. clone), it can be achieved through cloning.

You can clone the repository locally by executing commands
through the local command line:
`git clone https://gitee.com/smoa-new/valsex.git`

Or use mirrors:
`git clone https://github.com/smoa-o/valsex.git`
